                    {
                        "translation_id": "3ba761d8-96ac-464a-b89f-63453a4b9f11",
                        "source_entry_id": "6e541874-f1b7-39b1-a46c-74b0d8f98acd",
                        "source_sense_id": "8ffb42bb-b023-35eb-bea5-32a6a0cb8db5",
                        "target_lang_word": "nail clippers",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nail clippers",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bca1ff56-0cc9-392f-acf2-8f7b8a8c5506",
                                        "entry_id": "f676ba97-9ad0-36b2-850a-85e112d0b567",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mechanical device used to trim fingernails and toenails."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "plural",
                                            "plural-only"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8e57980c-8fc6-413d-b34d-92bfb888fb2a",
                                                "sense_id": "bca1ff56-0cc9-392f-acf2-8f7b8a8c5506",
                                                "text": "After their argument, Sprewell showed enormous restraint and presence of mind by not whipping out a pair of nail clippers and trimming his coach’s fingernails – an act for which he could have been seriously punished."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4dfe7588-d05a-4318-ab8a-22d77bdb6e53",
                                                "sense_id": "bca1ff56-0cc9-392f-acf2-8f7b8a8c5506",
                                                "text": "You know how you get those little fuzz balls on new carpet? With an instrument that looked like a normal-sized shaving razor this woman was rubbing the carpet to pull up the fuzz balls. This is a huge hotel, with lots of carpet. That’s like mowing three football fields with a pair of nail clippers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16f9be37-3e69-4798-8bec-dbc99b4580af",
                                                "sense_id": "bca1ff56-0cc9-392f-acf2-8f7b8a8c5506",
                                                "text": "Anyway, I grabbed a nail clipper (or is it a pair of nail clippers or is nailclipper one word?) I applied the clippers to the offending alpha-keratin and squeezed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a001b99e-78da-465c-972b-6848ef2aacbb",
                                                "sense_id": "bca1ff56-0cc9-392f-acf2-8f7b8a8c5506",
                                                "text": "You’ll definitely need a pair of nail clippers, a cuticle pusher and a nail file; depending on how thorough you want to get, you’ll also need a dry foot file, exfoliating scrub and moisturizer. If you really want to treat yourself, have a foot basin filled with warm water ready. Don’t skimp when it comes to the nail clippers and cuticle pusher."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f3277f65-1f6b-37d2-8632-6c2a160b8c40",
                                        "entry_id": "f676ba97-9ad0-36b2-850a-85e112d0b567",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mechanical device used to trim animals' claws."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
